{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tralalero Tralala vs. Frigo Camelo \u2014 who to choose? Who will be stronger and will smash the enemies to smithereens?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/extras/58b3e458c0bbcd48fa63ec572e6684f9.avif?t=1760543376\" width=1200 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEMOLOGY: WAR OF ITALIAN MEMES</strong> will immerse you in the amazing world of brain-company, in which you are free to do whatever you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/extras/4942d5088c2396f825f24f317cc92d6e.avif?t=1760543376\" width=1200 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEMOLOGY: WAR OF ITALIAN MEMES</strong> is a continuation of the legendary game <strong>MEMOLOGY: WAR OF MEMES,</strong> in which you have to build your own army of Italian animals and fight against other such armies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distribute the budget, take into account the characteristics of the characters, build your meme army and just enjoy this madness. We hope that you have completed all parts of MEMOLOGY and become the best meme commander!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/extras/01f758d22b9c2604d8015cec88a1b2d6.avif?t=1760543376\" width=1200 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Single player and multiplayer (up to 4 people)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 5 different and unique locations for battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Legendary Italian animals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Adjustable battle speed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Thoughtful story campaign for even more meaningfulness of the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Solid madness and unpredictability</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So which Italian animal will win?</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852580?t=1760543376","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3852580?t=1760543376","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/d29393444f24d88b41c07684f273d5eef538eef0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760543376","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/d29393444f24d88b41c07684f273d5eef538eef0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760543376","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tralalero Tralala vs. Frigo Camelo \u2014 who to choose? Who will be stronger and will smash the enemies to smithereens?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/extras/58b3e458c0bbcd48fa63ec572e6684f9.avif?t=1760543376\" width=1200 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MEMOLOGY: WAR OF ITALIAN MEMES</strong> will immerse you in the amazing world of brain-company, in which you are free to do whatever you want!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852580/extras/4942d5088c2396f825f24f317cc92d6e.avif?t=1760543376\" wid